==Strategy==
Simply use [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]], [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]] and one other meatshield (e.g., [[Pogo Cat (Rare Cat)|Jiangshi Cat]]) to soak up Iron Claw's attacks, while using lots of ranged attackers like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|dual]] [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dragons]], [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama Cats]], and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] to take him and the [[Kory|Kories]] out for an easy win.

==Trivia==
*Before this stage was fully implemented, its ID was used by an [https://youtube.com/watch?v=Sxgc-WCp-bA unfinished stage] with the placeholder name その１ (''Sono 1'', lit "That 1"), which spawned [[Cruel Angel Clionel]] and [[Gentleman Bros. (Enemy)|Gentleman Bros.]] at the beginning.

